{
  "slug": "year-11-gcse-exam-readiness-check",
  "title": "Is Your Year 11 Exam-Ready? Free 20-Point GCSE Readiness Check",
  "categories": [
    "032e7d84-db15-46ee-929d-e5e41e599678"
  ],
  "firstPublishedDate": "2026-09-12T11:38:21.842Z",
  "lastPublishedDate": "2026-09-12T11:38:21.842Z",
  "description": "A free Year 11 checklist for pupils and parents to identify whether revision is focused, active and exam-ready rather than simply time-consuming.",
  "body": [
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "This quick check is designed for Year 11 pupils and parents. Give one point for every statement that is genuinely true now, not something you intend to start doing later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "The 20-point check"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "ul",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I know the exam board for each of my GCSE subjects."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I know which papers I will sit and roughly what each paper tests."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I have a realistic weekly revision routine."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "My revision timetable includes breaks and days off."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I spend more time on weak areas than on topics I already enjoy."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I regularly retrieve information from memory rather than only rereading notes."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I complete exam-style questions every week."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I mark or check those questions carefully."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I keep a record of repeated mistakes."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I revisit mistakes after a few days rather than simply moving on."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I can identify my weakest three topics in English or Maths."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I can explain what examiners are looking for in the main question types."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I practise under timed conditions sometimes."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I know approximately how long to spend on major questions."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I can start a difficult question without waiting for someone to tell me exactly what to do."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I have useful revision resources organised in one place."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I sleep reasonably consistently on school nights."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I know what I will revise this week, rather than deciding at the last minute."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "I can name at least one concrete improvement I have made since my last assessment."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "If I get stuck, I know the next specific action to take."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "Your score"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "The bands below are informal prompts for reviewing the 20 habits, not validated thresholds. A high total does not establish subject knowledge or readiness for an exam. Choose practical next steps based on the statements you could not tick, rather than the score alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "ul",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "16–20: many of these planning habits are in place. Continue reviewing quality, timing and increasingly demanding exam practice."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "11–15: broadly on track, but several gaps are probably reducing the value of your revision. Fix the lowest-scoring areas first."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "6–10: revision may be happening, but it is not yet systematic enough. Build a simple routine around retrieval, exam questions and error correction."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "0–5: simplify. Do not create an elaborate timetable. Start with a small number of high-value habits and make them consistent."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "The three habits with the highest immediate value"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "ul",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "Retrieval: close the book and force yourself to produce the answer."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "Exam practice: apply knowledge in the form the exam actually requires."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "attrs": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "children": [
                "Error review: turn every mistake into a specific thing to practise again."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "This is a planning tool rather than a grade predictor. Its purpose is to identify behaviours you can actually change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
